        {
          "id": "e04d6a6a-d5d4-391c-b180-5f9755d02fe1",
          "content": {
            "id": "e04d6a6a-d5d4-391c-b180-5f9755d02fe1",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Mortgage rates higher, Rivian to use in-house AI chip over Nvidia's",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Producer <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/john-hyland/\">John Hyland</a> tracks Thursday's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/trending/\">top moving stocks</a> and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Mortgage rates ticked slightly higher this week, with the 30-year fixed rate sitting at 6.22% , according to the newest data from Freddie Mac (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FMCC\">FMCC</a>).</p>\n<p>Disney (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DIS\">DIS</a>) is investing $1 billion in OpenAI (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPAI.PVT\">OPAI.PVT</a>).</p>\n<p>Rivian (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RIVN\">RIVN</a>) unveiled in-house artificial intelligence (AI) chips for autonomous driving to replace Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) chips.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Yahoo Finance Senior Producer John Hyland tracks Thursday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute. Mortgage rates ticked slightly higher this week, with the 30-year fixed rate sitting at 6.22% , according to the newest data from Freddie Mac (FMCC). Disney (DIS) is investing $1 billion in OpenAI (OPAI.PVT). Rivian (RIVN) unveiled in-house artificial intelligence (AI) chips for autonomous driving to replace Nvidia (NVDA) chips. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
