            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Cisco & IBM's quantum internet, mortgage rates tick higher",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks Thursday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Bitcoin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) is extending recent declines, now under the $88,000 mark.</p>\n<p>Mortgage rates are ticking higher this week, with the 30-year fixed rate at 6.26% \u2014 up from 6.24% last week, according to data from Freddie Mac (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FMCC\">FMCC</a>).</p>\n<p>Cisco (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CSCO\">CSCO</a>) and IBM (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IBM\">IBM</a>) are partnering on a project that the companies say could lead to \"quantum internet.\"</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Yahoo Finance anchor Julie Hyman tracks Thursday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute. Bitcoin (BTC-USD) is extending recent declines, now under the $88,000 mark. Mortgage rates are ticking higher this week, with the 30-year fixed rate at 6.26% \u2014 up from 6.24% last week, according to data from Freddie Mac (FMCC). Cisco (CSCO) and IBM (IBM) are partnering on a project that the companies say could lead to \"quantum internet.\" Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
